{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，月干辛金七杀透出，时干庚金正官合身，官杀混杂且金旺克木，日主身弱无疑。年柱丙戌，丙火伤官生财，但戌土为燥土，财星旺而日主难以担财，通常代表出身普通，家庭经济条件一般，难以依靠祖业。月柱辛丑，七杀坐财库，父母辈可能辛劳奔波，但积累有限。时柱庚辰，正官合身，虽有约束，但辰土为湿土，能晦火养金，反而加重官杀压力。整体来看，命局财官旺而身弱，无印星化杀生身，早年家庭环境较为拮据，属于自力更生、白手起家之命，故出身应为贫穷或普通家庭。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3420, "response_id": "28245ffa-9ef6-4c12-a0a3-e3063c489b67", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 201, "total_tokens": 418, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 217}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
